  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx + 1/x = 33\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(x + 1/x)² = x² + 1/x² + 2\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ (33)² = x² + 1/x² + 2\n\n⇒ 1089 = x² + 1/x² + 2\n\n⇒ x² + 1/x² = 1089 − 2 = 1087\n\n**∴ x² + 1/x² = 1087**",
